Description: AI-Assisted Network Vulnerability Assessment System
 AIVAS scans network targets using Nmap, correlates findings against
 a local CVE database, and generates bilingual (English/Swahili)
 vulnerability reports with LLM-powered narration.
 .
 Features a Textual-based terminal UI and a web UI (FastAPI + React),
 supporting both Groq cloud and local Ollama inference.
